For the foregoing reasons, I pass the following:
ORDER i) The appeal is allowed-in-part;
ii) The judgment and award passed by Senior Civil Judge and Additional M.A.C.T,
Bailhongal in MVC.
No.831/2015 dated 01.12.2020, is modified;
Somayya S/O Basayya Pujer vs The Divisional Controller on 27 May, 2022 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/126548468/
6 iii) The claimant is entitled for total compensation of Rs.4,21,500/- as against Rs.3,75,200/-
awarded by the Tribunal;
iv) All other terms and conditions stipulated by the Tribunal shall stand intact and same are not disturbed.
v) Enhanced compensation shall be paid to the claimant by the respondent-Insurer within a period of four weeks along with interest at 6% per annum from the date of receipt of a certified copy of this judgment;
